# Run records of the I5 matching runs (not-whisky note, P59/P31) stay on the runner's PC (wiki
# Testing 4.4); only the reports (.md) are committed. mixed_report.json is the expected report
# that ai/regression/test_mixed_report.py compares with, not a run record.
/ai/runs/2026-11-21_i5_not_whisky/**/*.json
/ai/runs/2026-11-21_i5_not_whisky/**/*.jsonl
/ai/runs/2026-11-21_i5_not_whisky/**/*.log
